<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Your Account Has Been Transferred</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .header {
      background-color: #0047AB;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .header img {
      max-width: 200px;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 20px;
      background-color: #fff;
    }
    .footer {
      background-color: #f5f5f5;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #666;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: #0047AB;
      color: #ffffff !important;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    .info-box {
      background-color: #f9f9f9;
      border-left: 4px solid #0047AB;
      padding: 15px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    h1 {
      color: #0047AB;
      margin-top: 0;
    }
    h2 {
      color: #0047AB;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <img src="https://nexus.gonxt.tech/images/logo-white.png" alt="Nexus Solar Platform">
    </div>
    
    <div class="content">
      <h1>Account Transfer Notification</h1>
      
      <p>Hello {{firstName}},</p>
      
      <p>We're writing to inform you that your account has been transferred from <strong>{{sourceTenantName}}</strong> to <strong>{{destTenantName}}</strong> effective {{transferDate}}.</p>
      
      <div class="info-box">
        <h2>Transfer Details:</h2>
        <p><strong>From:</strong> {{sourceTenantName}}</p>
        <p><strong>To:</strong> {{destTenantName}}</p>
        <p><strong>Your Role:</strong> {{role}}</p>
        <p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> {{transferDate}}</p>
      </div>
      
      <p>Your account credentials remain the same, but you will now have access to {{destTenantName}}'s solar assets and data. The next time you log in, you'll be directed to your new tenant's dashboard.</p>
      
      <p>If you have any questions about this transfer or need assistance with your new access, please contact your administrator or our support team.</p>
      
      <a href="{{loginLink}}" class="button">Log In Now</a>
      
      <p>Thank you for using Nexus Solar Platform!</p>
      
      <p>Best regards,<br>
      The Nexus Solar Platform Team</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="footer">
      <p>© {{year}} Nexus Solar Platform. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p>This is an automated message, please do not reply to this email.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>